{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/2ac20baf7df55475dd1ae0490bdbc13f.avif?t=1768543365\" width=576 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blooming</strong> is a <strong>2D action platformer</strong> with a retro pixel art aesthetic, where chaos does not come from evil\u2026 but from your own god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Rose, a student of the Bastion School of Sorcery, now turned into a battlefield. An army of monsters has invaded the academy by order of the <strong>Celestial Creator</strong> himself, and only you can uncover why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the different sections of the school, each <strong>ruled by an elemental spirit.</strong> Defeat their guardians in any order you choose, claim their powers, and prepare to challenge the being who created everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side-scrolling action and platforming </strong>with precise controls and fast-paced combat. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c6335eeff0e92b77107cdc1bf08d555f.poster.avif?t=1768543365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c6335eeff0e92b77107cdc1bf08d555f.webm?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c6335eeff0e92b77107cdc1bf08d555f.mp4?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic-inspired combat: </strong>wield a bow that can transform into dual blades, allowing you to fight both at long and close range. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c613c4bbe2c713f2673d895294436261.poster.avif?t=1768543365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c613c4bbe2c713f2673d895294436261.webm?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c613c4bbe2c713f2673d895294436261.mp4?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental arrow system: </strong>each defeated boss unlocks a new arrow with unique abilities, switchable at any time. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/024f810cfdff799d64266068024cc5d9.poster.avif?t=1768543365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/024f810cfdff799d64266068024cc5d9.webm?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/024f810cfdff799d64266068024cc5d9.mp4?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear exploration: </strong>tackle areas and bosses in any order\u2026 though choosing the right element may give you the edge. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/45952826fbe518813b469ebf92ce3ea1.poster.avif?t=1768543365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/45952826fbe518813b469ebf92ce3ea1.webm?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/45952826fbe518813b469ebf92ce3ea1.mp4?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional bosses </strong>that enhance elemental arrows, rewarding exploration and mastery of combat. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/cf6ac5fd8ee99fb244152435f40a5444.poster.avif?t=1768543365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/cf6ac5fd8ee99fb244152435f40a5444.webm?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/cf6ac5fd8ee99fb244152435f40a5444.mp4?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource management in battle: </strong>defeat enemies to collect essence, used both for healing and ammunition.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/8f2a2582780edf9221cba612752e3917.poster.avif?t=1768543365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/8f2a2582780edf9221cba612752e3917.webm?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/8f2a2582780edf9221cba612752e3917.mp4?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-risk decision making: </strong>hiding will not save you. To survive, you must fight.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/9d70f5c45dc93eaf908d2ba51d1e2984.poster.avif?t=1768543365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/9d70f5c45dc93eaf908d2ba51d1e2984.webm?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/9d70f5c45dc93eaf908d2ba51d1e2984.mp4?t=1768543365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you bloom in a world that was never meant to exist?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2530280?t=1768543365","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2530280?t=1768543365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768543365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768543365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2539550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/2ac20baf7df55475dd1ae0490bdbc13f.avif?t=1768543365\" width=576 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blooming</strong> is a <strong>2D action platformer</strong> with a retro pixel art aesthetic, where chaos does not come from evil\u2026 but from your own god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Rose, a student of the Bastion School